# Supabase project (Postgres connection lives in backend/.env — this file
# only needs values consumed directly by the Vite frontend at build time).
#
# NOTE: File/image uploads (seat-deposit slips) are proxied through the
# backend using Supabase's S3-compatible Storage API. Never put S3 access
# keys or secret keys in frontend env vars — anything prefixed VITE_ is
# bundled into the public JS shipped to every visitor's browser.
